    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270136</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>雑貨屋ゴーリ１号店へようこそ。
こちらでは食材を扱っています♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Welcome to the general store, "Goalie" #1.
At this location, we deal in food products. ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270140</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270144</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>最近２号店を作って
道具と食材で分けたんですよ～
となりの道具２号店もよろしく♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We've started a #2 store recently. We sell
items at one store and food at the other~
Try out our #2 item store, just next door! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270148</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まったくうちの子と来たら
ろくでもない嫁連れてきたり
ひきこもったり……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm so sick of my son's shenanigans... He
brought home that good-for-nothing wife,
and now he holes himself up at home...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270148</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほんと世の中、憂い事だらけ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Honestly, the state of
the world these days...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私の愚痴、
聞いてくれるかしら？
少しだけでいいのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Would you let me grumble
at you for a bit? Just
for a moment or two.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぐちぐちぐちぐちぐちぐち……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grumble, grumble, grumble, grumble...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぐちぐちぐちぐちぐちぐち……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grumble, grumble, grumble, grumble...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぐちぐちぐちぐちぐちぐち……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grumble, grumble, grumble, grumble...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……なのよ……
ね？　たまんないでしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...and I just couldn't... See?
How terrible is that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>4</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まだ三歳の孫娘は
私を鬼ババ呼ばわりよ！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My granddaughter's only three, but
she's calling me an "old harpy"!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>絶対、あの嫁が
吹き込んだのよ！
どういうこと！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My daughter-in-law must
have taught her that! What
kind of mother would...!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほんと、まいったわよね。
世の中、いやなことばっか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Honestly, at this point? I give up.
Life's just so unpleasant, all the time!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>愚痴でも言わないと
やってられないのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If I can't at least grumble about
it, I won't be able to cope!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぐちぐちぐちぐちぐちぐち……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grumble, grumble, grumble, grumble...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぐちぐちぐちぐちぐちぐち……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grumble, grumble, grumble, grumble...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぐちぐちぐちぐちぐちぐち……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grumble, grumble, grumble, grumble...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>4</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……なのよ……
ね？　ヒドイでしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...and I just couldn't... See?
How cruel is that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>5</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>毎朝毎晩、食事の準備はいつも私。
嫁はいつも近所の奥さんと
おしゃべり三昧</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Who makes breakfast? Dinner? Me.
My daughter-in-law just chit-chats with
the neighborhood housewives, all day.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何なの、あの娘！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's her deal!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私の愚痴はストレス発散なの。
これやめろって言われたら
たぶん爆発しちゃうわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I grumble as stress relief. If I were
told to "knock it off," I'd probably
blow my top, just like that!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぐちぐちぐちぐちぐちぐち……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grumble, grumble, grumble, grumble...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
